# Jarvis brain: the llama3.2 variant of the tuned load-out.
#
# Same story as before: an 8192 context keeps the model resident in VRAM, which
# is what a spoken assistant needs (measured: 1-4 s per model call here, versus
# 20-30 s for qwen3:4b at 65k context).
#
# TEMPLATE is carried in this file deliberately. Ollama's stock llama3.2
# template instructs the model to "respond with a JSON for a function call"
# on EVERY final user turn when tools exist -- which made the model write
# {"name": ...} as plain text on ordinary greetings and small talk. The
# embedded template keeps the JSON tool-call format but restricts it to turns
# that actually need a tool. Edit config/ollama/Template.jarvis3b and re-run
# scripts/setup.ps1 (or ollama create) to change it.

FROM llama3.2:3b

TEMPLATE """<|start_header_id|>system<|end_header_id|>

Cutting Knowledge Date: December 2023

{{ if .System }}{{ .System }}
{{- end }}
{{- if .Tools }}When you receive a tool call response, use the output to format an answer to the orginal user question.

You are a helpful assistant with tool calling capabilities.
{{- end }}<|eot_id|>
{{- range $i, $_ := .Messages }}
{{- $last := eq (len (slice $.Messages $i)) 1 }}
{{- if eq .Role "user" }}<|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>
{{- if and $.Tools $last }}

Here are the functions available to you:
{{ range $.Tools }}
{{- . }}
{{ end }}

If, and only if, answering requires one of these functions, respond with a single
JSON object in the format {"name": function name, "parameters": dictionary of
argument name and its value}. Do not use variables. For everything else --
greetings, small talk, arithmetic, opinions, or answers you already have -- reply
with ordinary spoken prose. Never wrap prose in JSON.

{{ .Content }}<|eot_id|>
{{- else }}

{{ .Content }}<|eot_id|>
{{- end }}{{ if $last }}<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>

{{ end }}
{{- else if eq .Role "assistant" }}<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>
{{- if .ToolCalls }}
{{ range .ToolCalls }}
{"name": "{{ .Function.Name }}", "parameters": {{ .Function.Arguments }}}{{ end }}
{{- else }}

{{ .Content }}
{{- end }}{{ if not $last }}<|eot_id|>{{ end }}
{{- else if eq .Role "tool" }}<|start_header_id|>ipython<|end_header_id|>

{{ .Content }}<|eot_id|>{{ if $last }}<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>

{{ end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
"""

PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
PARAMETER temperature 0.2
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
